# @hub-lanes

# ── GITHUB PAT CHARGE ALERT ─────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Hourly at :17 (after gh-ledger-push's :03/:13 ticks have landed the previous
# hour from every box): read the fleet gh_ledger for the last complete UTC hour
# and write ONE logs/ALERTS.log line per (box, pat-*/graphql-pat-* bucket, UTC
# day) with counted calls >= GH_PAT_CHARGE_ALERT_MIN — the counter for the
# "App tokens everywhere, keyring logged out" migration. Zero GitHub calls.
# Off via GH_PAT_CHARGE_ALERT=0 or flags/lane-off-gh-pat-charge-alert.
17 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/gh-pat-charge-alert.sh hub >/dev/null 2>&1
